PROJECT: Movement Labs

## Core Insights

Insight 1: Modular Architecture Memisahkan Execution, Settlement, DA, dan Sequencing Menjadi Layer Terpisah yang Pluggable
Explanation: Movement Labs membangun stack modular di mana MoveVM/MEVM menangani execution, Ethereum L1 menyediakan settlement dan finality, DA layer (Celestia, Avail, EigenDA) bersifat pluggable via adapter, dan sequencer terpusat di testnet dengan rencana decentralized set untuk mainnet. Arsitektur ini memungkinkan fleksibilitas upgrade komponen tanpa mengganggu layer lain.
Evidence: System architecture modular dengan pemisahan layer eksplisit【Phase 4 — System Architecture】; DA Layer Adapters sebagai komponen terpisah di Movement SDK【Phase 4 — Core Components】; External dependencies menunjukkan 3 DA layer planned sebagai high priority【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】; Narrative position "Modular Blockchain" sebagai main narrative【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 7 (Ecosystem), Phase 8 (Market)
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 2: MEVM Menggunakan Transpiler EVM Bytecode ke Move Bytecode Bukan EVM-Equivalent Execution
Explanation: MEVM tidak mengeksekusi EVM bytecode secara native; ia mentranslasikan bytecode EVM ke Move bytecode untuk dijalankan di MoveVM. Pendekatan ini mendukung Hardhat/Foundry tooling tetapi bukan bytecode-compatible sepenuhnya, menciptakan kompatibilitas dengan gap teknis (precompiles, opcode, gas semantics).
Evidence: Execution environment MEVM transpiler【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】; Development framework Hardhat/Foundry support via MEVM【Phase 4 — Development Framework】; Major integration MEVM ↔ Hardhat/Foundry live di testnet【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】; Narrative position "EVM Compatibility" secondary bukan equivalence【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】; Known technical limitation MEVM tidak 100% kompatibel EVM【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 7 (Ecosystem), Phase 8 (Market)
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 3: Single Series A $38M Sebagai Satu-Satunya Funding Terverifikasi dengan Token Allocation Implied Tapi Unconfirmed
Explanation: Movement Labs hanya memiliki satu ronde funding publik terverifikasi (Series A $38M, 2024). Seed/pre-seed tidak tercatat di Crunchbase. Investor identity undisclosed. Token allocation untuk investor implied via SAFT/token warrant standar industri crypto VC tetapi tidak dikonfirmasi resmi.
Evidence: Funding history hanya Series A $38M terverifikasi【Phase 5 — Funding History】; Series A Investors undisclosed entity【Phase 2 — Entity】; Fundraising mechanism private sale assumed LOW confidence【Phase 5 — Fundraising Mechanism】; Distribution investors planned MEDIUM confidence【Phase 6 — Distribution】; Vesting investors assumed standar VC【Phase 6 — Vesting Schedule】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 2 (Entity), Phase 5 (Financial), Phase 6 (Token)
Confidence: MEDIUM

Insight 4: Pre-TGE Governance Vacuum — Semua Kendali Protocol Upgrade di Movement Labs Inc. Tanpa On-Chain Governance
Explanation: Tidak ada Foundation, DAO, Council, Committee, atau Validator Group. Token MOVE belum exist. Semua upgrade (MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK, M1 contracts) dikendalikan Movement Labs Inc. secara terpusat. Governance model "Planned" tapi semua parameter unknown. Foundation formation unconfirmed.
Evidence: Entity tidak ada Foundation/DAO【Phase 2 — Entity】; Fundraising mechanism Foundation tidak ada, DAO Treasury tidak ada【Phase 5 — Fundraising Mechanism】; Governance semua Unknown/Planned【Phase 6 — Governance】; Governance ecosystem semua tidak ada【Phase 7 — Governance Ecosystem】; Security model upgradeability controlled by Movement Labs Inc.【Phase 4 — Security Model】.
