Confidence: HIGH

Insight 5: Testnet-First Development dengan Centralized Components Sebelum Mainnet Readiness Complete
Explanation: Parthenon testnet live 2024-07-30 dengan centralized sequencer (Movement Labs operated), Ethereum testnet settlement, MEVM RPC, tanpa audit publik, tanpa DA adapters live, tanpa decentralized sequencing. Mainnet requirements (audit, DA adapters, decentralized sequencer) masih in progress.
