## Strategic Principles

Principle 1: Modular First — Memisahkan Setiap Komponen Arsitektur Menjadi Modul Independen yang Pluggable
Explanation: Setiap layer (execution, settlement, DA, sequencing) dikembangkan sebagai modul terpisah dalam Movement SDK. Tidak ada monolithic chain design. DA adapters, sequencer, VM, settlement contracts semuanya modular.
Evidence: System architecture modular stack【Phase 4 — System Architecture】; DA Layer Adapters sebagai komponen terpisah【Phase 4 — Core Components】; External dependencies 3 DA layers pluggable【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】; Narrative position Modular Blockchain main narrative【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 7 (Ecosystem), Phase 8 (Market)
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 2: EVM Compatibility via Translation Layer — Membangun MEVM Sebagai Transpiler Bukan EVM-Equivalent
Explanation: MEVM mentranslasikan EVM bytecode ke Move bytecode untuk dijalankan di MoveVM. Mendukung Hardhat/Foundry tooling tapi bukan bytecode-compatible. Pendekatan ini memungkinkan leverage MoveVM features (parallel execution, formal verification) sambil menarik Ethereum developers.
Evidence: Execution environment MEVM transpiler【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】; Development framework Hardhat/Foundry support【Phase 4 — Development Framework】; Major integration MEVM ↔ Hardhat/Foundry live【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】; Narrative position EVM compatibility secondary【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 7 (Ecosystem), Phase 8 (Market)
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 3: Ethereum Settlement Anchor — Semua Arsitektur Dibangun Di Atas Ethereum L1 Sebagai Settlement Layer Utama
Explanation: M1 dirancang sebagai L2 pada Ethereum. Testnet menggunakan Ethereum testnet. Bridge ke Ethereum. Tidak ada alternative settlement layer. Positioning sebagai Ethereum L2 bukan L1 kompetitor.
Evidence: Chain Ethereum L1 settlement【Phase 1 — Chain】; System architecture Ethereum settlement【Phase 4 — System Architecture】; External dependency Ethereum Critical【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】; Market position primary chain Ethereum【Phase 8 — Market Position】; Competitor landscape Ethereum L2s【Phase 8 — Competitor Landscape】.
