## Success Factors

Factor 1: Strong Technical Differentiation via MoveVM Parallel Execution dan Formal Verification
Explanation: MoveVM menawarkan parallel execution berbasis dependency graph dan formal verification via Move Prover — fitur yang tidak ada di EVM standard. Ini menciptakan technical moat vs Ethereum L2 competitors (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base) yang menggunakan EVM-equivalent execution.
Evidence: Execution environment MoveVM parallel execution【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】; Move Prover integration【Phase 4 — Development Framework】; Narrative position Parallel Execution dan Formal Verification secondary【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】; Competitor landscape vs Arbitrum/Optimism/Base EVM-equivalent【Phase 8 — Competitor Landscape】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 8 (Market)
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 2: MEVM EVM Compatibility Layer Memperluas Addressable Market ke Seluruh Ethereum Developer Ecosystem
Explanation: MEVM memungkinkan developer Ethereum existing deploy Solidity contracts tanpa modifikasi via Hardhat/Foundry. Addressable market bukan hanya Move-native developers (kecil) tapi seluruh Ethereum developer base (besar). Diferensiasi vs Aptos/Sui yang tidak punya EVM compatibility native.
Evidence: MEVM transpiler EVM bytecode ke Move bytecode【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】; Hardhat/Foundry support live di testnet【Phase 4 — Development Framework】; Major integration MEVM ↔ Hardhat/Foundry live【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】; Narrative position EVM compatibility secondary【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】; Competitor landscape Aptos/Sui no native EVM compatibility【Phase 8 — Competitor Landscape】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 7 (Ecosystem), Phase 8 (Market)
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 3: Series A $38M Funding Memberikan Runway Substansial untuk Pre-Mainnet Development
Explanation: Single large VC round $38M (2024) memungkinkan team expansion (30+ orang), infrastructure, audit preparation, mainnet launch preparation. Post-funding hiring 3 leadership roles (Head of Growth, Ecosystem, Operations) dalam waktu dekat.
Evidence: Series A funding $38M EV-006【Phase 3 — EV-006】; Funding history Series A $38M【Phase 5 — Funding History】; Hiring 3 leadership roles EV-008【Phase 3 — EV-008】; Entity Sami Kassab, Arjun Krishan, Tanya Kumar 2024-sekarang【Phase 2 — Entity】; Financial dependencies Series A primary【Phase 5 — Financial Dependencies】.
