## Failure Factors

Factor 1: Single Point of Failure — Centralized Sequencer di Testnet Tanpa Censorship Resistance
Explanation: Parthenon testnet menggunakan single sequencer dioperasikan Movement Labs. Single point of failure untuk transaction ordering. Tidak ada censorship resistance pada testnet. Mainnet launch gated oleh decentralized sequencer readiness yang spec-nya masih TBD.
Evidence: Consensus mechanism centralized testnet【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】; Parthenon testnet launch EV-009 centralized sequencer【Phase 3 — EV-009】; Ecosystem risk centralized sequencer testnet【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】; Open threads decentralized sequencer spec unknown【Phase 8 — Open Threads】.
