## Decision Framework

Step 1: Observe — Identifikasi Peluang Teknis dan Market Gap
Explanation: Founders mengidentifikasi peluang membawa Move language ke Ethereum melalui modular stack dengan EVM compatibility. MoveVM parallel execution + formal verification sebagai differentiator vs EVM. Ethereum L2 market growing tapi EVM-equivalent saturated.
Evidence: Founding EV-001 2022【Phase 3 — EV-001】; Vision blog post EV-007 "Move-based modular blockchain stack"【Phase 3 — EV-007】; Narrative position Modular Blockchain, MoveVM, Ethereum L2 main narratives【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 (History), Phase 8 (Market)

Step 2: Evaluate — Validasi Arsitektur Modular dengan Ethereum Settlement Anchor
Explanation: Keputusan arsitektur: MoveVM execution layer, Ethereum settlement layer, pluggable DA layer, sequencer layer. Pilih Ethereum sebagai settlement anchor (bukan L1 kompetitor). Pilih MEVM transpiler approach (bukan EVM-equivalent). Pilih Rust untuk core implementation.
Evidence: System architecture modular stack【Phase 4 — System Architecture】; Chain Ethereum L1 settlement【Phase 1 — Chain】; MEVM transpiler approach【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】; Programming languages Rust core【Phase 4 — Programming Languages】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 1 (Foundation), Phase 4 (Technology)

Step 3: Fund — Series A $38M VC Funding untuk Capital Intensive Development
Explanation: Raise $38M Series A 2024 dari undisclosed investors. Capital deployment ke team expansion (30+ orang), infrastructure, audit preparation, mainnet launch preparation. Post-funding immediate hiring 3 leadership roles.
Evidence: Series A funding EV-006 2024【Phase 3 — EV-006】; Funding history Series A $38M【Phase 5 — Funding History】; Hiring EV-008 3 leadership roles【Phase 3 — EV-008】; Entity Sami Kassab, Arjun Krishan, Tanya Kumar【Phase 2 — Entity】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 (History), Phase 5 (Financial), Phase 2 (Entity)

Step 4: Develop — Build Infrastructure, SDK, VM, MEVM, Testnet Secara Paralel
Explanation: GitHub organization 2023, docs site 2024, Discord community 2023. Development: Movement SDK, MoveVM, MEVM, Movement CLI, TypeScript SDK. Testnet Parthenon launch 2024-07-30 dengan centralized sequencer, Ethereum testnet settlement, MEVM RPC.
Evidence: GitHub EV-003, Docs EV-004, Discord EV-005【Phase 3 — EV-003, EV-004, EV-005】; Core components MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK【Phase 4 — Core Components】; Parthenon testnet launch EV-009【Phase 3 — EV-009】; Technical upgrade history Parthenon launch【Phase 4 — Technical Upgrade History】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 (History), Phase 4 (Technology)

Step 5: Launch — Testnet-First Public Launch Sebelum Mainnet Readiness Complete
Explanation: Parthenon testnet live 2024-07-30 dengan known limitations (centralized sequencer, no audit, no DA adapters live, no decentralized sequencing). Developer feedback collection, narrative momentum, infrastructure validation. Mainnet launch target belum diumumkan.
Evidence: Parthenon testnet launch EV-009【Phase 3 — EV-009】; Consensus mechanism centralized testnet planned decentralized【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】; Audit history no public audit【Phase 4 — Audit History】; DA adapters planned not live【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】; Market timeline mainnet launch unscheduled【Phase 8 — Market Timeline】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 (History), Phase 4 (Technology), Phase 7 (Ecosystem), Phase 8 (Market)

Step 6: Partner — Announce Pluggable DA Layer Integrations (Celestia, Avail, EigenDA)
Explanation: Announce 3 DA layer integrations sebagai planned roadmap. DA adapters sebagai SDK modules. Tidak commit ke single DA. Narrative completeness, ecosystem breadth. Technical implementation in progress.
Evidence: DA layer integration announcement EV-010【Phase 3 — EV-010】; DA Layer Adapters core component【Phase 4 — Core Components】; External dependencies 3 High Planned DA【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】; Major integrations 3 Planned DA Adapters【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】.
